      "title": "-",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# OmniVoice TTS\n\n  ## Auto-Download\n\n  **Models auto-download on first run** - no manual setup needed!\n\n  | Model | VRAM | Size |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice (fp32) | ~8-12GB | ~4GB |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | ~4-6GB | ~2GB |\n  ---\n\n  ## Manual Download\n\n  | File | Size | Link |\n  |------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice (Full fp32) | ~4GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | ~2GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16) |\n\n\n```\n  \u9983\u6428 ComfyUI/\n  \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 models/\n  \u9239?  \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 omnivoice/\n  \u9239?  \u9239?     \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 OmniVoice/\n  \u9239?  \u9239?     \u9239?     \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac config.json\n  \u9239?  \u9239?     \u9239?     \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac model.safetensors\n  \u9239?  \u9239?     \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 OmniVoice-bf16/\n  \u9239?  \u9239?            \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac config.json\n  \u9239?  \u9239?            \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac model.safetensors\n  \u9239?  \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 audio_encoders/\n  \u9239?         \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 openai_whisper-large-v3-turbo/\n  \u9239?         \u9239?     \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac config.json\n  \u9239?         \u9239?     \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac model.safetensors\n  \u9239?         \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac \u9983\u6428 openai_whisper-medium/\n  \u9239?                \u9239\u6ebe\u6522\u9239\u20ac config.json\n  \u9239?                \u9239\u65ba\u6522\u9239\u20ac model.safetensors\n```\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Whisper ASR models (for auto-transcription)\n\n  | Model | VRAM | Link |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | whisper-large-v3-turbo | ~1.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo) |\n  | whisper-large-v3 | ~3GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3) |\n  | whisper-medium | ~1.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-medium) |\n  | whisper-small | ~0.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-small) |\n  | whisper-tiny | ~0.4GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-tiny) |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Non-verbal expression tags:\n\n  `[laughter]` `[sigh]` `[sniff]` `[question-en]` `[question-ah]` `[question-oh]` `[question-ei]` `[question-yi]` `[surprise-ah]` `[surprise-oh]` `[surprise-wa]` `[surprise-yo]` `[dissatisfaction-hnn]` `[confirmation-en]`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Voice design attributes (comma-separated):\n\n  | Category | Options |\n  |----------|---------|\n  | Gender | `male`, `female` |\n  | Age | `child`, `young`, `middle-aged`, `elderly` |\n  | Pitch | `very low pitch`, `low pitch`, `medium pitch`, `high pitch`, `very high pitch` |\n  | Style | `whisper` |\n  | English Accents | `american accent`, `british accent`, `australian accent`, `canadian accent`, `indian accent`, `irish accent`, `scottish accent`, `south african accent` |\n  | Chinese Dialects | `\u9365\u6d98\u7a9b\u7487\u6f19, `\u95c4\u66e1\u30bf\u7487\u6f19, `\u9a9e\u5938\u7b22\u7487\u6f19, `\u6d93\u6ec3\u5bf3\u7487\u6f19, `\u705e\u53d8\u7b22\u7487\u6f19, `\u5a0c\u51b2\u5d21\u7487\u6f19, `\u6d93\u5a43\u6363\u7487\u6f19, `\u95c2\u85c9\u5d21\u7487\u6f19, `\u7039\u3220\ue18d\u7487\u6f19 |\n\n  **Example:** `female, young, high pitch, british accent, whisper`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Multi-speaker dialogue format:\n\n  [Speaker_1]: Hello, I'm speaker one.\n  [Speaker_2]: And I'm speaker two!\n  [Speaker_1]: Nice to meet you!\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Links\n\n  - Original [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice)\n  - Models [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) / [OmniVoice-bf16](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16)\n  - Paper [arXiv:2604.00688](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.00688)\n  - Issues [Report Bug](https://github.com/saganaki22/ComfyUI-OmniVoice-TTS/issues)"
      ],
      "color": "#c09430",
      "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)"
